data: {"id": "b407e4a5186c4e5c-final", "run_id": "b407e4a5186c4e5c", "seq": 1653, "ts_ms": 1789048969325, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 卡在 ContainerCreating (Pending) 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 状态 `Pending`，等待原因 `ContainerCreating` | 确认核心异常现象 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (持续 65m) | 提供导致挂载失败的确切缺失资源标识 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`: unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input] (持续 63m) | 证实挂载超时机制正在发生 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1 (labels: `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 独立于 Event 的指标佐证 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod 条件 `ContainersReady=False`, `reason=ContainersNotReady`, `message=containers with unready status: [app]` | 确认应用容器未就绪状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 0 | 证实容器从未成功启动过，无重启循环 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：\n- **2** 号事件明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，直接解释了 **1**、**3**、**4** 号事实中显示的挂载失败与容器无法启动现象。\n- **6** 号指标确认容器状态为初始失败（0 次重启），排除了容器启动后崩溃（CrashLoopBackOff）的可能。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nSpec 中引用 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → 该 ConfigMap 不存在于 aiops-case-03 命名空间 → kubelet 挂载卷失败 (FailedMount) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 的卷配置引用了一个在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在的 ConfigMap（名称为 `unavailable-config`）。\n\n这一缺失导致 `kubelet` 在尝试挂载卷时失败并持续超时（见证据 2 和 3），容器引擎因此无法完成启动过程，使 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 1、4 和 5）。Pod 尚未启动，因此未产生任何应用日志或 Tracing 数据。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 30.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 45.7s (Evidence 36.9s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 85.596, "metrics": {"run_id": "b407e4a5186c4e5c", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 85.60107445716858, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 85601.07445716858, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 82012.53318786621, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successf